To access - mongosh

To create database - USE db8

To access fatabase - Use db8 

To create a collection/Table - db.createCollection("employees")

To insert data - db.employees.insertOne({})

To insert Many data - db.employees.insertMany({})

To find/read - db.employees.find({"gender":"Male"})
