To find single data we can use insertone -  db.employees.findOne({"gender":"Male"})
{
  _id: ObjectId('6a7aca03e314d553c12900e3'),
  id: 6,
  first_name: 'Pepillo',
  gender: 'Male'
}

db.employees.find({"gender":"Male"}).count()
42


To updateone data - db.employees.updateOne({"id":6},{$set:{"name":santhosh}})

To updateMany data- db.employees.updateMany({},{$set:{"esal":45000}})

To delete the table -db.employees.drop


To find the gender:male and age>40 - db.users.findOne({"gender":"Male},"age":{$gte:40})